{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"GHSA-866g-f22w-33x8","published":"2026-05-18T00:31:37Z","modified":"2026-09-08T16:30:06.120590930Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-8769"],"summary":"@ai-sdk/provider-utils has an Uncontrolled Resource Consumption issue","details":"Versions of `@ai-sdk/provider-utils` before 3.0.28, from 4.0.0 before 4.0.33, and from 5.0.0 before 5.0.1 are vulnerable to uncontrolled resource consumption. The `createJsonResponseHandler`, `createJsonErrorResponseHandler`, and `createStatusCodeErrorResponseHandler` functions in `packages/provider-utils/src/response-handler.ts` read response bodies without a shared size limit, allowing a remote attacker with low privileges to cause excessive memory consumption. The exploit has been publicly disclosed and may be utilized.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"@ai-sdk/provider-utils","ecosystem":"npm","purl":"pkg:npm/%40ai-sdk/provider-utils"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.0.28"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/05/GHSA-866g-f22w-33x8/GHSA-866g-f22w-33x8.json"}},{"package":{"name":"@ai-sdk/provider-utils","ecosystem":"npm","purl":"pkg:npm/%40ai-sdk/provider-utils"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"4.0.0-beta.10"},{"fixed":"4.0.33"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/05/GHSA-866g-f22w-33x8/GHSA-866g-f22w-33x8.json"}},{"package":{"name":"@ai-sdk/provider-utils","ecosystem":"npm","purl":"pkg:npm/%40ai-sdk/provider-utils"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"5.0.0-beta.0"},{"fixed":"5.0.1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/05/GHSA-866g-f22w-33x8/GHSA-866g-f22w-33x8.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-8769"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/